                                "sense_id": "f60d1658-8b39-3443-8e7a-7aa45a6c2a07",
                                "text": "Ik volg je gedachtelijn, maar ik ben het niet met je eens.",
                                "translation": "I follow your line of thought, but I disagree with you.",
                                "english": "I follow your line of thought, but I disagree with you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f151c88-9cfb-4d13-8c64-dd0eb7db8842",
                                "sense_id": "f60d1658-8b39-3443-8e7a-7aa45a6c2a07",
                                "text": "Haar gedachtelijn is altijd duidelijk en logisch.",
                                "translation": "Her way of thinking is always clear and logical.",
                                "english": "Her way of thinking is always clear and logical."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37757d73-ece1-4796-bb07-424e9ebd5087",
                                "sense_id": "f60d1658-8b39-3443-8e7a-7aa45a6c2a07",
                                "text": "De discussie veranderde van gedachtelijn toen nieuwe feiten naar voren kwamen.",
                                "translation": "The discussion shifted in its line of thought when new facts emerged.",
